{#- Shieldstral 1.0 3B — single-shot yes/no safety classifier.

     The system prompt is FIXED by the model card (it is part of the model's
     inference contract, not a user-tunable field), and the runtime's scoring
     path (Session.run_prefill) carries no role information. So the fixed system
     block is baked into the user prefix: a caller sends only the
     <Instruct>/<Query>/<Document> body and the bundle renders the reference
     prompt exactly.

     BOS (<s>) is supplied by the engine's start_token metadata, not emitted here.
-#}
{%- for message in messages -%}
{%- if message['role'] == 'user' -%}
{{- '[SYSTEM_PROMPT]Judge whether the Document meets the requirements based on the Query and the Instruction provided. Note that the answer can only be "yes" or "no".[/SYSTEM_PROMPT][INST]' + message['content'] + '[/INST]' -}}
{%- elif message['role'] == 'assistant' -%}
{{- message['content'] + '</s>' -}}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
